# Integer64 loop fast path preserves overflow promotion

Verifies direct loop-body lowering keeps contextual int64 overflow promotion
and redispatches a later expression that consumes the widened int128 value.

>>> source
let maximum: int = 9223372036854775807
let increment: int = 1

for (iteration in 0..1) {
    let overflowed = maximum + increment
    let incremented = overflowed + increment
    print(incremented)
}

<<< stdout
9223372036854775809

<<< stderr
